#: src/svnfrontend/editpropsdlg.cpp:44 src/svnfrontend/editpropsdlg.cpp:84
#, kde-format
msgid "One of <b>'native'</b>, <b>'LF'</b>, <b>'CR'</b>, <b>'CRLF'</b>."
msgstr ""
"<b>'native'</b>（依照系统）、<b>'LF'</b>、<b>'CR'</b> 或 <b>'CRLF'</b> 之一。"

#: src/svnfrontend/editpropsdlg.cpp:46 src/svnfrontend/editpropsdlg.cpp:86
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If present, make the file executable.<br/>This property can not be set on a "
"directory. A non-recursive attempt will fail, and a recursive attempt will "
"set the property only on the file children of the folder."
msgstr ""
"若存在，将文件标记为可执行。<br/>这个属性不能设置在目录上。在目录上时尝试非递"
"回地设置时会失败，而递归地设置时则只会在文件夹下的文件上设置这个属性。"

#: src/svnfrontend/editpropsdlg.cpp:51
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Keywords to be expanded into the contents of a file.<br/>They can be "
"inserted into documents by placing a keyword anchor which is formatted as "
"$KeywordName$.<br/>Valid keywords are:<br/><b>URL/HeadURL</b> The URL for "
"the head revision of the project.<br/><b>Author/LastChangedBy</b> The last "
"person to change the file.<br/><b>Date/LastChangedDate</b> The date/time the "
"object was last modified.<br/><b>Revision/Rev/LastChangedRevision</b> The "
"last revision the object changed.<br/><b>Id</b> A compressed summary of the "
"previous 4 keywords."
msgstr ""
"要展开到文件内容中的关键字。<br/>借由将关键字定锚用 $关键字名称$ 格式写在文档"
"内，它们可以被插入文档中。<br/>有效的关键字是：<br/><b>URL/HeadURL</b> 项目"
"的 HEAD 修订版的网址。<br/><b>Author/LastChangedBy</b> 最后修改文件的人。<br/"
"><b>Date/LastChangedDate</b> 对象最后修改的日期/时间。<br/><b>Revision/Rev/"
"LastChangedRevision</b> 对象最后变更的修订版。<br/><b>Id</b> 前四个关键字的简"
"短概要。"

#: src/svnfrontend/editpropsdlg.cpp:61
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Set this to any value (e.g. <b>'*'</b>) to enforce locking for this file.<br/"
">The file will be set read-only when checked out or updated, indicating that "
"a user must acquire a lock on the file before they can edit and commit "
"changes."
msgstr " 将其设为任意值（例如 <b>'*'</b>）可强制此文件必须锁定。<br/>该文件在检出或更新时会被设为只读，表示用户必须先取得该文件的锁才能编辑并提交修改。"

#: src/svnfrontend/editpropsdlg.cpp:66 src/svnfrontend/editpropsdlg.cpp:100
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The mimetype of the file. Used to determine whether to merge the file and "
"how to serve it from Apache. A mimetype beginning with <b>'text/'</b> (or an "
"absent mimetype) is treated as text. Anything else is treated as binary."
msgstr " 文件的 MIME 类型。用于决定是否合并该文件，以及 Apache 如何提供该文件。以 <b>'text/'</b> 开头（或不存在）的 MIME 类型被视为文本，其余视为二进制文件。"

#: src/svnfrontend/editpropsdlg.cpp:93
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A newline separated list of module specifiers, each consisting of a relative "
"directory path, optional revision flags, and a URL. For example:<br/"
"><nobr><b>foo http://example.com/repos/projectA</b></nobr><br/><nobr><b>foo/"
"bar -r 1234 http://example.com/repos/projectB</b></nobr>"
msgstr ""
"用换行来分隔的模块指定器列表，每个模块指定器包含一个相对目录路径、可有可无的"
"修订版标志，以及一个网址。例如：<br/><nobr><b>foo http://example.com/repos/"
"projectA</b></nobr><br/><nobr><b>foo/bar -r 1234 http://example.com/repos/"
"projectB</b></nobr>"

#: src/svnfrontend/editpropsdlg.cpp:98
#, kde-format
msgid "A newline separated list of file patterns to ignore."
msgstr "用换行分隔的忽略文件模式列表。"

#: src/svnfrontend/editpropsdlg.cpp:104
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Label text to show for the edit box where the user enters the issue number."
msgstr "要为用户输入议题编号的编辑框显示的标记文字。"

#: src/svnfrontend/editpropsdlg.cpp:108
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"URL pointing to the issue tracker. It must contain <b>%BUGID%</b> which gets "
"replaced with the bug issue number. Example:<br/><nobr><b>http://example.com/"
"mantis/view.php?id=%BUGID%</b></nobr>"
msgstr ""
"指向议题追踪 (issue tracker) 的网址。它必须包含 <b>%BUGID%</b>，这会被换成议"
"题编号。例：<br/><nobr><b>http://example.com/mantis/view.php?id=%BUGID%</b></"
"nobr>"

#: src/svnfrontend/editpropsdlg.cpp:112
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"String which is appended to a log message when an issue number is entered. "
"The string must contain <b>%BUGID%</b> which gets replaced with the bug "
"issue number."
msgstr ""
"有输入议题编号时会加到日志消息后方的字符串。字符串中必须包含 <b>%BUGID%</b>，"
"它会被替换成议题编号。"

#: src/svnfrontend/editpropsdlg.cpp:116
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Set to <b>'yes'</b> if a warning shall be shown when no issue is entered in "
"the commit dialog. Possible values:<br/><b>'true'</b>/<b>'yes'</b> or "
"<b>'false'</b>/<b>'no'</b>."
msgstr ""
"如果提交对话框中未输入议题时应该显示警告，请设为 <b>'yes'</b>。可能的值："
"<br/><b>'true'</b>/<b>'yes'</b> 或 <b>'false'</b>/<b>'no'</b>。"

#: src/svnfrontend/editpropsdlg.cpp:120
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Set to <b>'false'</b> if your bugtracking system has issues which are "
"referenced not by numbers.<br/>Possible values: <b>'true'</b> or <b>'false'</"
"b>."
msgstr ""
"如果您的错误追踪系统有不使用编号进行参照的议题，请设为 <b>'false'</b>。<br/>"
"可能的值：<b>'true'</b> 或 <b>'false'</b>。"

#: src/svnfrontend/editpropsdlg.cpp:124
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Set to <b>'false'</b> if you want the bugtracking ID to be inserted at the "
"top of the log message. The default is <b>'true'</b> which means the "
"bugtracking ID is appended to the log message."
msgstr ""
"如果您希望错误追踪 ID 要插入在日志消息顶端，请设为 <b>'false'</b>。默认是 "
"<b>'true'</b>，代表错误追踪 ID 是加到日志消息尾端的。"

#: src/svnfrontend/editpropsdlg.cpp:129
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Two regular expressions separated by a newline.<br/>The first expression is "
"used to find a string referring to an issue, the second expression is used "
"to extract the bare bug ID from that string."
msgstr ""
"两个正则表达式，以换行符分开。<br/>第一个正则表达式用来查找提到议题的字符串，"
"第二个正则表达式用来从那个字符串取出独立的错误/议题 ID。"

